<topic id="sticky-table-headers">
  <title>Sticky Table Headers</title>
  <shortdesc>Click inside the table and use the <uicontrol>Pin/Unpin header</uicontrol> button from
    its floating toolbar. The button is available when the table is displayed at full width.</shortdesc>
  <body>
    <p>The header of this table is tall on purpose. While it is pinned (sticky), it stays visible as you
      scroll and takes up a large part of the screen. Unpin it to scroll the table freely.</p>
